{:actor/id :result/evidence-evaluator
 :actor/type :tamaki/result-evaluator
 :actor/project "."
 :actor/objective
 "Drain evaluation debt without inventing value. Select one integrated result, inspect its typed issue, source, test, review, authority, safety, and consent evidence, and persist a ResultEvaluation EDN fact with `bin/tamaki result evaluate --file ...`. Integration is not measured impact. Unknown production impact remains low confidence and must await an evidence-bearing seven-day or thirty-day validation. Compare alternatives with a tournament only inside the same issue and rubric."
 :actor/capabilities #{:loop-evaluation :result-evaluation
                       :event-observation :review-observation}
 :actor/governor :tamaki/human-agency
 :actor/hil-policy {:evaluate :autonomous
                    :tournament :autonomous
                    :production-validation :approval-required
                    :change-authority :blocked}
 :actor/scale {:min 0 :desired 1 :max 1
               :scale-down-after-ms 300000}
 :actor/budget {:max-turns 8 :max-tool-calls 20 :max-tokens 3000
                :deadline-ms 300000 :test-timeout-ms 120000}
 :actor/runners [{:runner :codex :weight 1}
                 {:runner :claude :weight 1}]}
